---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy policy for this game guide site.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p><em>Last updated: 2026.</em></p>

      <h2>1. Information we collect</h2>
      <p>
        We do not collect any personal information directly. We use third-party advertising
        partners that may collect anonymized usage data such as page views, referrer, and
        general location (country level).
      </p>

      <h2>2. Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        Our advertising partners may set cookies for frequency capping and basic analytics.
        You can disable cookies in your browser settings without affecting site access.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Third-party services</h2>
      <p>
        We use advertising networks to display ads. These networks have their own privacy
        policies. We do not control or endorse their practices.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        For privacy questions, please reach out via the <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
